    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=tvHG0MEXOUVoCLuO]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=tvHG0MEXOUVoCLuO]]-foot Cone. <em>Failure:</em> The target can’t take &amp;Reference[Reaction] until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s next turn, and the target rolls [[/r 1d8]] to determine what it does on its next turn:</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>1–4.</strong> The target does nothing.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>5–6.</strong> The target takes no action or Bonus Action and uses all its movement to move in a random direction.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>7–8.</strong> The target makes a melee attack against a random creature within its reach or does nothing if it can’t make such an attack.</p>",
